  "title": "✨50% OFF NOW! Metal Chrome Polish & Restorer Paste with Brush – Heavy-Duty Chrome Polishing Cream, Oxidation Remover for Car Wheels, Metal Trim, Faucets & Chrome Surfaces",
  "handle": "metrush",
  "description": "<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">FEATURES</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">RESTORE BRILLIANT MIRROR SHINE</span></strong> - Smooth scratch free formula brings dull chrome to life</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184422_c998ab52feca50b12458e1875f932138.png?v=1791801866\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">METAL SURFACES LOSE SHINE</span></strong> - Heavy rust and stubborn water spots ruin premium metal fixtures</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184427_8adfd1298d5d5e99023ca8f02ca0c6a8.png?v=1791801872\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">EFFORTLESS FINE POLISHING ACTION</span></strong> - Precision brush easily distributes the smooth paste into tight corners</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184432_f632c53048dcaef86918a35b330528f6.png?v=1791801877\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">DEEP REFLECTIVE CHROME GLOW</span></strong> - Restores a brilliant spotless glow to premium household fixtures</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184437_fca1c305a9aae199b5a4b03ca5cbf92d.png?v=1791801882\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">ADVANCED SCRATCH FREE FORMULA</span></strong> - Smooth non scratching paste delivers professional detailing results safely</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184442_327ad074663a0b8bf4fc65535d45a3ef.png?v=1791801887\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">UNIVERSAL MULTI METAL CARE</span></strong> - Versatile formula cleans car wheels and bathroom fixtures effectively</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184448_e1a5bfc4f5431d46da7790658bb658d5.png?v=1791801893\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">SHIELD AGAINST FUTURE TARNISH</span></strong> - Invisible barrier locks in shine and resists harsh weather</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0580/9963/0214/files/spp_shopify20261012184453_c7a7b07883c3996bdae19493424bcb3e.png?v=1791801898\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">SPEC</span></strong></p>\n<p>Color: Silver</p>\n<p>Net Content: 100 g (3.53 oz)</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">PACKAGE INCLUDES</span></strong></p>\n<p>1 x Paste + 1 x Brush / 2 x Paste + 2 x Brushes</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">NOTES</span></strong></p>\n<p>Color may not appear exactly as in real life due to variations between computer monitors.</p>",
